{{fi-pronunciation|a=Fi-perjantai.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{enum|fi|torstai|lauantai|day of the week|pe}}
{{fi-noun}}

# [[Friday]] {{gloss|day of the week; the fifth day of the week in Finland and in the ISO 8601 standard}}

====Usage notes====
As with all days of the week in Finnish, the essive case ({{m|fi||perjantaina}}) is usually used when talking about what will happen or happened on a Friday.

